$grp PS_MissionDescription : "{3136BE42592F3B1B}PrefabsEditable/MissionDescription/EditableMissionDescription.et" {
 CS {
  coords 574.161 76.987 7291.685
  m_sTitle "Comsig"
  m_sTextData "<h2>CALLSIGNS</h2>"\
  "• HQ - 211HQ"\
  "• 1SQD - 211"\
  "• 2SQD - 212"\
  "• 3SQD - 213"\
  "• 4SQD - 214"\
  "• 5SQD - 215"\
  ""\
  "<h2>FREQ/CHAN</h2>"\
  "• Platoon net - 42hz"\
  ""\
  "<h2>PASSWORDS</h2>"\
  "All can be changed at CO's discretion."\
  "• <b>Challenge:</b> Apple | <b>Password:</b> Oyster"\
  "• Running password: 12"
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "RHS_AFRF"
  }
  m_iOrder 5
 }
 EF {
  coords 574.161 76.987 7291.685
  m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "Reports indicate approximately seven armed workers remain in control of the coal refinery. The group consists of former refinery employees who have taken up arms. They are located on the top floor but have freedom of movement within the building."\
  "They could hold the top floor, push down the stairs and hold lower, or even counter attack into us if we take to long outside."\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• Armed with a variety of modern AK-pattern rifles,machine guns, including RPDs and PKMs, have reportedly been sighted."\
  "Some personnel may carry GP-25 under-barrel grenade launchers and anti-tank launchers."\
  ""\
  "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
  "The group is believed to be operating with equipment seized or acquired prior to the takeover. Their ammunition reserves, available supplies and ability to sustain a prolonged defence are unknown."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "RHS_AFRF"
  }
  m_iOrder 2
 }
 FF {
  coords 574.161 76.987 7291.685
  m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "We are a 24-man Russian SOBR special detachment, designated <b>Vityaz-7</b>."\
  "We begin outside the building, on the ground floor directly in front of its only entrance. Beyond the entrance, a large series of staircases leads upwards through roughly six floors. The structure consists of multiple levels with small rooms, leading to a large, open working gantry on the top floor, offering a 360-degree view of the surrounding outside area and a ladder access onto the exposed roof."\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• Our sharpshooter has been postioned in the hills to the north. He has total freedom of movement and can go where he wishes."\
  "(If he enters the AO limit around the building, he wont be able to leave)"\
  ""\
  "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
  "• No vehicle support."\
  "• No reinforcements."\
  "• No rearm or resupply during the operation."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "RHS_AFRF"
  }
  m_iOrder 3
 }
 MIS {
  coords 574.161 76.987 7291.685
  m_sTitle "Mission"
  m_sTextData "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
  "Clear the coal refinery of all armed miners in order to secure the complex."\
  ""\
  "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
  "Russian SOBR forces are to advance through the refinery, clear all floors and rooms, and eliminate the armed workers occupying the complex. All armed miners must be neutralised before the building can be considered secure."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "RHS_AFRF"
  }
  m_iOrder 4
 }
 SIT {
  coords 574.161 76.987 7291.685
  m_sTitle "Situation"
  m_sTextData "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
  ""\
  "DTL: 14/10/2018, 0715hr, Gorshkovo, Cain."\
  ""\
  "Weather: Random"\
  ""\
  "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
  "For years, the workers at the coal refinery have been expected to work longer hours for wages that have barely kept pace. Attempts to negotiate better conditions, organise through unions and take action through protests have achieved little. Management has remained unmoved, and the workforce has had enough."\
  ""\
  "What began as a dispute over pay and working hours has now turned violent. Armed workers have seized weapons and equipment, turning on management and killing those within the complex who weren't part of the workforce. The refinery is now in the hands of the very people who keep it running."\
  ""\
  "With the situation beyond the control of the site's ordinary security, Russian SOBR forces have been deployed to restore order. The workers have made their move; now the refinery is about to become a battleground."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "RHS_AFRF"
  }
  m_iOrder 1
 }
}